# size  weight  characters used at that size (space is always included)
# @strings stands for every character found in the user interface strings, @titles for those of the screen titles,
# alarm levels and guide page titles (the only text in the 20 point font).
# Only the glyphs listed here end up in flash.
12 regular @strings 0123456789.,-+:/%ABCDEFGHIJKLMNOPQRSTUVWXYZabcdefghijklmnopqrstuvwxyz
12 medium  @strings 0123456789.,-+:/%ABCDEFGHIJKLMNOPQRSTUVWXYZabcdefghijklmnopqrstuvwxyz
14 medium  @strings 0123456789.,-+:/%ABCDEFGHIJKLMNOPQRSTUVWXYZabcdefghijklmnopqrstuvwxyz
20 medium  @titles 0123456789.,-+:/%!ABCDEFGHIJKLMNOPQRSTUVWXYZabcdefghijklmnopqrstuvwxyz
28 medium  AORWY
34 medium  0123456789.-%+
48 medium  0123456789.-:
